      "writtenOn": "2017-06-21T20:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Coverity\u0027s comment is true for the 1st iteration of the for loop in that sleep_usec will be assigned the value of bc12_wait_usec for port 0 each time the task is run. But, if port 0 needs a wait, the sleep_usec will be a positive value (the wait time before needing to read the bc12 type). Port 1 can also request a wait and if it\u0027s shorter than what port 0 needs, this value would get assigned.",
      "parentUuid": "c9b72eb2_3a7382c5",
